GIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <!-- PC端图片 --> <img class=\"pct_i product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/3ca88daa1fd74c80961991e4b6928dbd/1.png\" height=\"700\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\" width=\"1188\"/></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Product Specifications 零件模板 -->\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; font-weight: bold; height: 120px; width: 111.864%;\"><!-- 物品清单布局 --><!-- 标题加文案结束 --> <!-- 表头 -->\n<thead class=\"pct_th\">\n<tr style=\"height: 40px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #adadad; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; height: 40px; width: 13.6939%; padding: 10px !important;\">\n<div>Product ID</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #adadad; font-weight: bold; height: 40px; width: 16.6547%; padding: 10px !important;\">\n<div>Connector Type</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #adadad; font-weight: bold; height: 40px; width: 12.5836%; padding: 10px !important;\">Operating Current <br/>(A)</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #adadad; font-weight: bold; height: 40px; width: 13.1387%; padding: 10px !important;\">Operating Voltage <br/>(V)</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #adadad; font-weight: bold; height: 40px; width: 15.1743%; padding: 10px !important;\">Product Dimensions<br/>(mm)</td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 15px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; text-align: center; height: 15px; width: 13.6939%; padding: 10px !important;\">\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-page-id=\"OsAldE1cUoGAUQxg1D4cwL9Xnqc\">XA013</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; height: 15px; width: 16.6547%; padding: 10px !important;\">\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-page-id=\"OsAldE1cUoGAUQxg1D4cwL9Xnqc\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E2TsdMkJuoukcexwn4Uckptnnqf\">SH1.0 to SH1.0</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; height: 15px; width: 12.5836%; padding: 10px !important;\">1A</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; height: 15px; width: 13.1387%; padding: 10px !important;\">3~6V</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; height: 15px; width: 15.1743%; padding: 10px !important;\">12.7*5.2*4.74</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 15px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; text-align: center; height: 15px; width: 13.6939%; padding: 10px !important;\">\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-page-id=\"OsAldE1cUoGAUQxg1D4cwL9Xnqc\">XA018</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; height: 15px; width: 16.6547%; padding: 10px !important;\">\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-page-id=\"OsAldE1cUoGAUQxg1D4cwL9Xnqc\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E2TsdMkJuoukcexwn4Uckptnnqf\">SH1.0 to SH1.0</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; height: 15px; width: 12.5836%; padding: 10px !important;\">1A</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; height: 15px; width: 13.1387%; padding: 10px !important;\">3.3V</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; height: 15px; width: 15.1743%; padding: 10px !important;\">14*6.5*4.8</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<br/><!-- Application -->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\"></div>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Application</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Embedded system development</strong>: Ideal for prototyping and integrating components in embedded system projects.</li>\n<li><strong>Circuit debugging and testing</strong>: Simplifies troubleshooting and ensures reliable circuit performance during testing.</li>\n<li><strong>Modular device interconnections</strong>: Enables seamless connectivity between modular devices for efficient integration.</li>\n<li><strong>Signal and power transmission for compact devices</strong>: Ensures stable signal and power flow in space-constrained device setups.</li>\n<!-- 文本模块 结尾--></ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 20px; text-align: center; font-size: 24px;\">Important Notices</h2>\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Pin alignment</strong>: Ensure correct pin alignment when connecting cables. Reversing the polarity may cause short circuits and damage connected devices.</li>\n<li><strong>Choking hazard</strong>: This product contains small parts. Keep out of reach of children to avoid accidental ingestion.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
  "description_text": "The SH1.0 to SH1.0 Connector Adapter Board facilitates seamless SH1.0 connection, delivering reliable signal and power transmission for compact devices and modular systems. It can also be paired with a Wire Pair with SH1.0 connectors, serving as an extension kit for enhanced SH1.0 connection capabilities.\n\nEmbedded system development: Ideal for prototyping and integrating components in embedded system projects.\n\nCircuit debugging and testing: Simplifies troubleshooting and ensures reliable circuit performance during testing.\n\nModular device interconnections: Enables seamless connectivity between modular devices for efficient integration.\n\nSignal and power transmission for compact devices: Ensures stable signal and power flow in space-constrained device setups.\n\nPin alignment: Ensure correct pin alignment when connecting cables. Reversing the polarity may cause short circuits and damage connected devices.\n\nChoking hazard: This product contains small parts. Keep out of reach of children to avoid accidental ingestion.",
